msgid "Configuring your repository"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:80
msgid ""
"Each project is configured with an SSH key pair consisting of a public "
"and private key. Your repository will need to be configured with the "
"public SSH key in order to allow builds to clone your repository."
