#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:145
msgid "Configuring repository webhooks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/creating-project-private-repository.rst:147
msgid ""
"Your repository will also need to be configured to push updates via "
"webhooks to Read the Docs on repository events. Webhook updates are used "
"to automatically trigger new builds for your project and synchronize your"
" repository's branches and tags."
msgstr ""

